{"title":"Betty Oliphant Theatre: ProArteDanza (contemporary ballet/dance)  $40 promo","startsAt":"2026-11-01T14:00:00-05:00","endsAt":"2026-11-01T16:00:00-05:00","status":"ACTIVE","type":"PHYSICAL","description":"Certainly one of Toronto's most important dance groups!!!\n\nWe will join them again (3rd time) for a Sunday afternoon performance. November 1\n\nhttps://www.proartedanza.com/\n\n*Ticket link below*. **OUR** price $40 per ticket.\n\n(Regular price is $55 per ticket).\n\n\\*\\*\\*ProArteDanza continues to deliver some of the most vital and rigorously crafted contemporary dance in the country.\n\n*Paula Citron, Dance Critic*\n\n**ProArteDanza is a repertory contemporary dance company** which challenges and inspires its artists and our audience through **bold new work** and invests in the future of the art form through educational programs.\n​\nCommitted to *“passion in performance”*, ProArteDanza strives to reach the widest possible audience through an open, equitable and inclusive culture which fosters artistic risk-taking, innovation and collaboration.\n\nhttps://www.proartedanza.com/copy-of-fall-season-2026\n\n**Ticket link here**:\nhttps://www.zeffy.com/en-CA/ticketing/fall-2026-season-2\n\nUSE promo code: **MEETUP** for the $40 tickets.\n\n**ONLY** available on the ADULT tickets.\n\n**ALL** tickets purchased will need to be ADULT--not the Seniors.\n\n(you can also adjust the 'added donation' tab as needed\n\n**General admission seating**. Venue holds about 250 people.\n\nArrive on time/in advance--*WE can all sit together.*\n\nThe Dora Award-winning company performs contemporary ballet. By that, I mean that the dancers need ballet training to execute the movement. Technique is important, especially when they have to negotiate the intricate and often arduous movement constructed by co-choreographers **Roberto Campanella** and **Robert Glumbek**.","venue":{"name":"Betty Oliphant Theatre","address":"404 Jarvis St, Toronto, ON M4Y 2G6, Canada, Toronto","lat":43.66421,"lng":-79.377849,"city":"Toronto"},"fee":null,"group":"TORONTO ARTS & CULTURE","image":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/2/6/a/3/highres_451449891.jpeg"}